{"schema_version":"1.7.5","id":"SUSE-SU-2026:0528-1","published":"2026-02-15T06:33:50Z","modified":"2026-03-23T04:52:19.440367Z","related":["CVE-2023-53321","CVE-2025-38111","CVE-2025-38352","CVE-2025-39742"],"upstream":["CVE-2023-53321","CVE-2025-38111","CVE-2025-38352","CVE-2025-39742"],"summary":"Security update for the Linux Kernel (Live Patch 24 for SUSE Linux Enterprise 15 SP5)","details":"\nThis update for the SUSE Linux Enterprise kernel 5.14.21-150500.55.97 fixes various security issues\n\nThe following security issues were fixed:\n\n- CVE-2023-53321: wifi: mac80211_hwsim: drop short frames (bsc#1250314).\n- CVE-2025-38111: net/mdiobus: Fix potential out-of-bounds read/write access (bsc#1249455).\n- CVE-2025-38352: posix-cpu-timers: fix race between handle_posix_cpu_timers() and posix_cpu_timer_del() (bsc#1249205).\n- CVE-2025-39742: RDMA: hfi1: fix possible divide-by-zero in find_hw_thread_mask() (bsc#1249480).\n","affected":[{"package":{"name":"kernel-livepatch-SLE15-SP4_Update_40","ecosystem":"SUSE:Linux Enterprise Live Patching 15 SP4","purl":"pkg:rpm/suse/kernel-livepatch-SLE15-SP4_Update_40&distro=SUSE%20Linux%20Enterprise%20Live%20Patching%2015%20SP4"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"13-150400.2.1"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"binaries":[{"kernel-livepatch-5_14_21-150400_24_164-default":"13-150400.2.1"}]},"database_specific":{"source":"https://ftp.suse.com/pub/projects/security/osv/SUSE-SU-2026:0528-1.json"}},{"package":{"name":"kernel-livepatch-SLE15-SP5_Update_24","ecosystem":"SUSE:Linux Enterprise Live Patching 15 SP5","purl":"pkg:rpm/suse/kernel-livepatch-SLE15-SP5_Update_24&distro=SUSE%20Linux%20Enterprise%20Live%20Patching%2015%20SP5"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"14-150500.2.1"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"binaries":[{"kernel-livepatch-5_14_21-150500_55_97-default":"14-150500.2.1"}]},"database_specific":{"source":"https://ftp.suse.com/pub/projects/security/osv/SUSE-SU-202